# Trivy ignore — AI Telegram News Bot image
#
# Both entries below are Debian system packages under
# /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages (they ship with the python:3.11-slim
# base image, Debian trixie). The pip-space copies ARE upgraded in the
# Dockerfile deps stage (setuptools>=83.0.0, wheel>=0.46.2) — verify with:
#   docker run --rm ai-news-bot:ci pip show setuptools wheel
# The system copies are managed by apt, not pip; suppressing them here
# until the base image ships fixed versions.
#
# CVE-2025-47273: setuptools path traversal in PackageIndex — not
# reachable: the image never runs setuptools at runtime (the bot runs
# from installed wheels; no build/install steps post-install).
CVE-2025-47273

# GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964: msgpack out-of-bounds read on Unpacker reuse —
# not reachable: msgpack exists only as a base-image system package and
# is not imported by the bot or any of its runtime dependencies.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
